name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q7_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'A student wants to use an AI writing assistant to help complete a class essay. Which approach best demonstrates responsible AI use?'

wrong 'Copy the AI\'s output directly into the assignment without reading it.'
wrong 'Ask the AI to write the entire essay and submit it as your own work.'
right 'Use the AI to brainstorm ideas, then write the essay yourself and review any AI suggestions critically.'
wrong 'Avoid using AI entirely, since it is always harmful to use in school.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

